{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"MGASA-2026-0573","published":"2026-11-04T16:19:14Z","modified":"2026-11-04T16:30:03.276253099Z","summary":"Updated minetest package fixes security vulnerabilities","details":"The client mesh loaders suffer from memory safety issues including\nunbounded out-of-bounds heap writes and use-after-free, which might be\nused to obtain arbitrary code execution on the client. (High)\nInstalling content from an untrusted ContentDB instance can result in\nremote code execution. (Moderate)\nSingleplayer: Lua sandbox escape from mod (Critical)\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"minetest","ecosystem":"Mageia:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/mageia/minetest?arch=source&distro=mageia-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"5.18.0-1.1.mga10"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"section":"core"},"database_specific":{"source":"https://advisories.mageia.org/MGASA-2026-0573.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://advisories.mageia.org/MGASA-2026-0573.html"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugs.mageia.org/show_bug.cgi?id=36583"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/luanti-org/luanti/security/advisories/GHSA-352v-4qmr-gmp7"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/luanti-org/luanti/security/advisories/GHSA-j2v5-g52g-685j"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/luanti-org/luanti/security/advisories/GHSA-5373-9cjp-qfmg"}],"credits":[{"name":"Mageia","contact":["https://wiki.mageia.org/en/Packages_Security_Team"],"type":"COORDINATOR"}]}